sequenceDiagram
    participant Main as main agent
    participant Red as RED agent
    participant Green as GREEN agent
    participant Hook as PostToolUse hook
    participant Coach as habit_coach.py
    participant HH as habit-hooks
    participant SS as structure_signals.py
    participant Val as VALIDATE agent
    participant Att as attempt file

    Main->>Red: spawn for the slice
    Red-->>Main: failing tests
    Main->>Green: spawn for the slice
    Green->>Green: write a new file
    Green->>Hook: Write event
    Hook->>Coach: run for the GREEN agent
    Coach->>HH: scan the file
    HH-->>Coach: smell findings
    Coach->>SS: ask for structure signals
    SS-->>Coach: findings JSON for new files
    Coach-->>Green: advice, no cap, no block
    Green-->>Main: slice done
    Main->>Val: spawn for the slice
    Val->>SS: run on the slice
    SS-->>Val: findings JSON and not-analysed list
    Val->>Val: judge contract drift on the diff
    Val->>Att: write Structure block, outside the score
    alt attempt FAILS
        Att-->>Green: Structure block goes to the next attempt
    end
